quation of the parabola, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{(x+2)^{2}}{25} & =y-2 \\\\ {(x+2)}^{2} & =25(y-2)\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351563 #edb/ref 1080 "x+5=-{t}^{2},\\,y+3=6t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351563 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351563 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "003023ae-1aa2-54a4-98df-d8e7ff22066d" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351612 #edb/ref 1080 "x+5=-4{t}^{2},\\,y+3=12t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351612 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351612 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "04a61724-2b44-5a05-b9c5-ee7e18a029b9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351811 #edb/ref 1080 "x-2=2{t}^{2},\\,y-2=4t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351811 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351811 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "1b17b005-eeb9-5b45-8c4e-b6cf57ce3220" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351902 #edb/ref 1080 "x-5=-3{t}^{2},\\,y-3=3t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351902 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351902 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "249bff29-1e23-57f0-a40d-6219e1c53f7b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351906 #edb/ref 1080 "x-5=-3{t}^{2},\\,y-3=-6t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351906 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351906 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "252094cb-c77d-5625-a2e6-f8d7aa811973" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351943 #edb/ref 1080 "(y-1)^{2}=\\frac{5}{2}(x+1)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351943 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186351943 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "288c1c06-2498-55be-af84-64025de5b036" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352063 #edb/ref 1080 "x+2=2{t}^{2},\\,y+2=4t" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352063 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352063 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "352cb32e-5d32-597a-ac9d-bd2257ed30f4" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186352194 